+**Not Adopted (requires unsafe or Tauri integration):**
+- Receipt-sequenced paste (paste_tx/) — requires objc2/Win32 unsafe
+- Layout-aware macOS paste (input.rs) — requires enigo/Carbon unsafe
+- Concealment markers — requires objc2 for NSPasteboard
 
